<tr><td>Symmetrical polyarthritis（像 RA，但 seronegative）</td><td><strong class="ex-n">15%</strong></td></tr>
<tr><td>DIP joints（classical psoriatic arthropathy）</td><td>約 <strong class="ex-n">5%</strong></td></tr>
